 2297: // /**
 2298: //    For a point (x1,y1) inside the element and a line segment (x1,y1)-(x2,y2), find the intersection point 
 2299: //    (xIntersect,yIntersect) and the side (intersectingSide) that it intersects.
 2300: 
 2301: //    Inputs:
 2302: //    @param x1, y1: point inside the element
 2303: //    @param x2, y2: other end of the line segment
 2304: 
 2305: //    Outputs:
